{"fps": 30, "frames": 1570, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 155, "text": "The day war broke out in Europe, a young man ordered the worst stocks in America.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 8, "e": 14}, {"w": "day", "f": 14, "e": 20}, {"w": "war", "f": 21, "e": 27}, {"w": "broke", "f": 27, "e": 37}, {"w": "out", "f": 37, "e": 43}, {"w": "in", "f": 44, "e": 48}, {"w": "Europe,", "f": 49, "e": 62}, {"w": "a", "f": 62, "e": 65}, {"w": "young", "f": 66, "e": 75}, {"w": "man", "f": 76, "e": 82}, {"w": "ordered", "f": 82, "e": 95}, {"w": "the", "f": 95, "e": 101}, {"w": "worst", "f": 102, "e": 111}, {"w": "stocks", "f": 112, "e": 123}, {"w": "in", "f": 124, "e": 128}, {"w": "America.", "f": 129, "e": 143}]}, {"a": 155, "b": 301, "text": "Every stock on the New York exchange under one dollar. A hundred shares of each.", "words": [{"w": "Every", "f": 157, "e": 166}, {"w": "stock", "f": 167, "e": 176}, {"w": "on", "f": 177, "e": 181}, {"w": "the", "f": 182, "e": 188}, {"w": "New", "f": 189, "e": 195}, {"w": "York", "f": 196, "e": 203}, {"w": "exchange", "f": 204, "e": 219}, {"w": "under", "f": 219, "e": 229}, {"w": "one", "f": 230, "e": 236}, {"w": "dollar.", "f": 236, "e": 249}, {"w": "A", "f": 250, "e": 253}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 253, "e": 266}, {"w": "shares", "f": 267, "e": 278}, {"w": "of", "f": 279, "e": 283}, {"w": "each.", "f": 284, "e": 293}]}, {"a": 301, "b": 374, "text": "Imagine you're his broker, reading that list.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 303, "e": 313}, {"w": "you're", "f": 314, "e": 323}, {"w": "his", "f": 324, "e": 329}, {"w": "broker,", "f": 329, "e": 340}, {"w": "reading", "f": 341, "e": 351}, {"w": "that", "f": 352, "e": 358}, {"w": "list.", "f": 359, "e": 367}]}, {"a": 374, "b": 488, "text": "A hundred and four companies. Thirty-four already bankrupt.", "words": [{"w": "A", "f": 376, "e": 379}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 380, "e": 393}, {"w": "and", "f": 394, "e": 400}, {"w": "four", "f": 401, "e": 409}, {"w": "companies.", "f": 409, "e": 428}, {"w": "Thirty-four", "f": 429, "e": 449}, {"w": "already", "f": 449, "e": 463}, {"w": "bankrupt.", "f": 463, "e": 480}]}, {"a": 488, "b": 657, "text": "The buyer is John Templeton, a young Tennessean who paid for college with poker winnings.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 490, "e": 496}, {"w": "buyer", "f": 497, "e": 507}, {"w": "is", "f": 508, "e": 512}, {"w": "John", "f": 513, "e": 521}, {"w": "Templeton,", "f": 522, "e": 541}, {"w": "a", "f": 541, "e": 544}, {"w": "young", "f": 545, "e": 555}, {"w": "Tennessean", "f": 556, "e": 575}, {"w": "who", "f": 575, "e": 582}, {"w": "paid", "f": 582, "e": 591}, {"w": "for", "f": 591, "e": 598}, {"w": "college", "f": 598, "e": 612}, {"w": "with", "f": 613, "e": 621}, {"w": "poker", "f": 622, "e": 632}, {"w": "winnings.", "f": 632, "e": 650}]}, {"a": 657, "b": 758, "text": "And he's buying with borrowed money, while everyone else sells.", "words": [{"w": "And", "f": 659, "e": 664}, {"w": "he's", "f": 665, "e": 671}, {"w": "buying", "f": 672, "e": 681}, {"w": "with", "f": 682, "e": 689}, {"w": "borrowed", "f": 689, "e": 702}, {"w": "money,", "f": 702, "e": 712}, {"w": "while", "f": 712, "e": 721}, {"w": "everyone", "f": 721, "e": 734}, {"w": "else", "f": 734, "e": 741}, {"w": "sells.", "f": 741, "e": 751}]}, {"a": 758, "b": 852, "text": "So why buy bankrupt companies in the middle of a war?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 760, "e": 764}, {"w": "why", "f": 765, "e": 771}, {"w": "buy", "f": 771, "e": 777}, {"w": "bankrupt", "f": 778, "e": 791}, {"w": "companies", "f": 792, "e": 807}, {"w": "in", "f": 807, "e": 811}, {"w": "the", "f": 812, "e": 818}, {"w": "middle", "f": 818, "e": 829}, {"w": "of", "f": 829, "e": 833}, {"w": "a", "f": 834, "e": 836}, {"w": "war?", "f": 837, "e": 844}]}, {"a": 852, "b": 951, "text": "You see, an umbrella shop in a drought sells for pennies.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 854, "e": 859}, {"w": "see,", "f": 860, "e": 867}, {"w": "an", "f": 868, "e": 872}, {"w": "umbrella", "f": 872, "e": 886}, {"w": "shop", "f": 886, "e": 893}, {"w": "in", "f": 894, "e": 898}, {"w": "a", "f": 899, "e": 901}, {"w": "drought", "f": 902, "e": 914}, {"w": "sells", "f": 914, "e": 923}, {"w": "for", "f": 924, "e": 929}, {"w": "pennies.", "f": 930, "e": 943}]}, {"a": 951, "b": 1010, "text": "Nobody wants it. Then it rains.", "words": [{"w": "Nobody", "f": 953, "e": 963}, {"w": "wants", "f": 964, "e": 972}, {"w": "it.", "f": 973, "e": 979}, {"w": "Then", "f": 979, "e": 987}, {"w": "it", "f": 987, "e": 991}, {"w": "rains.", "f": 992, "e": 1002}]}, {"a": 1010, "b": 1112, "text": "The war was the rain. Idle factories filled with orders.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1012, "e": 1018}, {"w": "war", "f": 1018, "e": 1024}, {"w": "was", "f": 1025, "e": 1031}, {"w": "the", "f": 1031, "e": 1037}, {"w": "rain.", "f": 1038, "e": 1047}, {"w": "Idle", "f": 1048, "e": 1056}, {"w": "factories", "f": 1056, "e": 1072}, {"w": "filled", "f": 1073, "e": 1084}, {"w": "with", "f": 1084, "e": 1092}, {"w": "orders.", "f": 1092, "e": 1105}]}, {"a": 1112, "b": 1249, "text": "Within about four years, his junk pile was up roughly four hundred percent.", "words": [{"w": "Within", "f": 1114, "e": 1126}, {"w": "about", "f": 1126, "e": 1136}, {"w": "four", "f": 1136, "e": 1144}, {"w": "years,", "f": 1145, "e": 1156}, {"w": "his", "f": 1156, "e": 1163}, {"w": "junk", "f": 1163, "e": 1171}, {"w": "pile", "f": 1172, "e": 1179}, {"w": "was", "f": 1180, "e": 1186}, {"w": "up", "f": 1187, "e": 1191}, {"w": "roughly", "f": 1192, "e": 1205}, {"w": "four", "f": 1205, "e": 1213}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 1214, "e": 1226}, {"w": "percent.", "f": 1227, "e": 1242}]}, {"a": 1249, "b": 1335, "text": "Only four of those companies ended up worthless.", "words": [{"w": "Only", "f": 1251, "e": 1258}, {"w": "four", "f": 1259, "e": 1266}, {"w": "of", "f": 1267, "e": 1271}, {"w": "those", "f": 1271, "e": 1280}, {"w": "companies", "f": 1281, "e": 1296}, {"w": "ended", "f": 1297, "e": 1305}, {"w": "up", "f": 1306, "e": 1310}, {"w": "worthless.", "f": 1311, "e": 1328}]}, {"a": 1335, "b": 1437, "text": "He called it buying at the point of maximum pessimism.", "words": [{"w": "He", "f": 1337, "e": 1341}, {"w": "called", "f": 1342, "e": 1352}, {"w": "it", "f": 1353, "e": 1357}, {"w": "buying", "f": 1357, "e": 1368}, {"w": "at", "f": 1368, "e": 1373}, {"w": "the", "f": 1373, "e": 1379}, {"w": "point", "f": 1379, "e": 1388}, {"w": "of", "f": 1389, "e": 1393}, {"w": "maximum", "f": 1394, "e": 1406}, {"w": "pessimism.", "f": 1406, "e": 1423}]}, {"a": 1437, "b": 1504, "text": "And years later, his one regret?", "words": [{"w": "And", "f": 1439, "e": 1444}, {"w": "years", "f": 1445, "e": 1453}, {"w": "later,", "f": 1454, "e": 1464}, {"w": "his", "f": 1464, "e": 1470}, {"w": "one", "f": 1470, "e": 1476}, {"w": "regret?", "f": 1476, "e": 1488}]}, {"a": 1504, "b": 1570, "text": "He sold too soon.", "words": [{"w": "He", "f": 1506, "e": 1511}, {"w": "sold", "f": 1512, "e": 1521}, {"w": "too", "f": 1521, "e": 1528}, {"w": "soon.", "f": 1529, "e": 1540}]}]}